  <summary>An open-source Bittorrent client</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      qBittorrent Enhanced Edition is a fork of qBittorrent and provides more powerful functions.
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>Auto Ban Xunlei, QQ, Baidu, Xfplay, DLBT and Offline downloader</li>
      <li>Auto Ban Unknown Peer from China Option (Default: OFF)</li>
      <li>Auto Update Public Trackers List (Default: OFF)</li>
      <li>Auto Ban BitTorrent Media Player Peer Option (Default: OFF)</li>
      <li>Peer whitelist/blacklist</li>
    </ol>
  </description>
